# Human template + rationale. The actual p2.inf is GENERATED by the build (genFeatureP2Inf) from
# -PevolveIu / -PevolveVersion — this file is documentation + an up-to-date input; the literal values
# below are illustrative.
#
# Pins the EXACT Evolve version so p2 refuses to install onto a mismatched Evolve (fail-closed — no
# blank IDE; a failed refresh keeps the prior working artifact).
#
# We pin **dev.equo.swt.evolve.feat.hybrid.feature.group** (per Matias' handoff): `equo modernize`
# always installs feat.hybrid (in BOTH web and desktop mode — the -Ddev.equo.swt.mode flag is a runtime
# rendering toggle, not a different install; feat.web is only used by cloudify, which never installs
# add-ons). feat.hybrid's version == the Evolve release version, the SAME across every Eclipse line, so
# ONE repo + ONE pin. The version is the Evolve tag we built against (e.g. 0.336.0).
#
# Example after generation (Evolve 0.336):
#   requires.1.namespace = org.eclipse.equinox.p2.iu
#   requires.1.name = dev.equo.swt.evolve.feat.hybrid.feature.group
#   requires.1.range = [0.336.0,0.336.0]

requires.1.namespace = org.eclipse.equinox.p2.iu
requires.1.name = dev.equo.swt.evolve.feat.hybrid.feature.group
requires.1.range = [0.0.0,0.0.0]
